{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/batchLimit"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchLimit","identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The 100 events are what TelemetryDeck’s SwiftSDK sends in a request. The 333,333 bytes of an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event are a third of Ingest API v3’s limit: TelemetryDeck refuses a whole request when one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event’s JSON is over 1,000,000 bytes as its server writes it, which may be larger than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encoder’s, and a third leaves room for the escapes a re-encoder commonly adds, such as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\u"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and four hex digits for a character outside ASCII, and a space after each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":","},{"type":"text","text":". A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"larger event is left out as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TelemetryDeck documents no limit on a request; its 1,000,000 bytes are the encoder’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bound, the most one event may be, which keeps a request to a size a retry can send again."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"TelemetryDeck’s limits on one request: 100 events and 1,000,000 bytes of body, and 333,333","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bytes of one event.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/telemetrydeckencoding\/telemetrydeckbatchencoder\/batchlimit"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Property","title":"batchLimit","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"TelemetryDeckEncoding"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift#L134"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BatchLimit","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:21TelemetryDeckEncoding0aB12BatchEncoderV10batchLimit12PropertyJSON0dG0VvpZ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding","doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://PropertyJSON/documentation/PropertyJSON/BatchLimit":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The most an ingestion endpoint takes in one request: how many records, how many bytes of body,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and how many bytes of one record’s JSON."}],"title":"BatchLimit","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchLimit"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\